[00:14.04]We live in the time of the harvest,
[00:18.96]A priv’lege beyond all compare.
[00:24.46]The wheat fields stand ready before us,
[00:29.56]And eagerly we have a share.
[00:34.82]With Jesus, our finest example,
[00:40.08]Directing our work in the field,
[00:45.22]How happy and honored we feel each day.
[00:50.52]We joyfully share in the yield.
[01:53.12]True love for our God and our neighbor
[02:00.80]Now moves us to speed up our pace.
[02:06.36]Both preaching and teaching are urgent,
[02:14.34]For shortly the end we will face.
[02:28.16]The joy we receive is a blessing,
[02:33.54]A gift that Jehovah provides.
[02:38.70]By faith we endure till this work is done
[02:43.70]And joyfully share at his side.
